# =============================================================================
# The Avenue — environment variables
# =============================================================================
#
# This project currently requires NO environment variables.
#
# Every page is statically prerendered at build time, all content comes from
# data/avenue.ts, and every image, font and video is served from public/.
# There are no API keys, no database, and no external services.
#
# Nothing needs to be entered in Vercel's Environment Variables panel.
#
# If one is added later, declare it here with a placeholder value (never a real
# secret) so the required set stays documented. Client-exposed variables must
# be prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_.
#
# Example:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://example.com
